      "open": true,
      "text": "Selected action (reading only):\nhire porter (8 drams)\n\nYou see a clay loading marker.\nPack two measures of clay and set the box at this loading marker. Manual carrying remains free.\nHow to use: Carry one measure at a time or both loose without a fee. To hire the porter, pack both measures into the box and bring it here.\nCost and limits: A shorter clear walk can lower the next fare. The hire quote includes the current route and the weight of the packed box. Hard pack room is the remaining space under your pack limit. The weight on the HUD shows your strength allowance. The porter earns one dram at pickup and the rest on receipt. If the parcel returns, you get the remaining fare back. The porter pauses while you are away from this area. The order stays booked.\nRight now you can: hire porter (8 drams).\n\nThe porter takes a packed clay box from this spot to the shelf by the well. Speak here after packing. Carry it yourself if the route is unsafe or the fare is too dear."
    },
